---
// Ashly 3.0 Welcome / Hero Component
---

<section
  class="relative pt-8 pb-20 md:pt-14 md:pb-28 overflow-hidden dot-matrix-bg"
>
  <!-- Ambient glow orbs -->
  <div
    class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[850px] h-[450px] bg-sky-600/15 blur-[150px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[550px] h-[400px] bg-purple-600/15 blur-[140px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center flex flex-col items-center"
  >
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div
      class="hero-badge inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/90 border border-ashly-cyan/40 text-xs text-ashly-cyan font-mono shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(23,184,254,0.15)] mb-6 sm:mb-8"
    >
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-ashly-cyan animate-ping"></span>
      ASISTENTE VIRTUAL IA CON PRESENCIA 3D &amp; AUTOMATIZACIÓN LOCAL
    </div>

    <!-- Main Title (Properly closed, perfectly spaced) -->
    <h1
      class="hero-title text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.25rem] font-sora font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.14] max-w-5xl mx-auto select-none"
    >
      <span class="block">
        <span
          class="hero-word inline-block will-change-transform cursor-default"
          >Tu</span
        >{" "}
        <span
          class="hero-word inline-block will-change-transform cursor-default"
          >compañera</span
        >{" "}
        <span
          class="hero-word inline-block will-change-transform cursor-default"
          >inteligente</span
        >{" "}
        <span
          class="hero-word inline-block will-change-transform cursor-default"
          >que</span
        >
      </span>
      <span class="block mt-2 sm:mt-3">
        <span
          class="hero-word hero-highlight inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-ashly-cyan via-sky-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent filter drop-shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(23,184,254,0.45)] will-change-transform cursor-default"
        >
          Opera en tu ordenador.
        </span>{" "}
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Justified Description Text (Generous vertical space between title and description) -->
    <p
      class="hero-desc text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light text-justify [text-align-last:center] mt-8 sm:mt-11 mb-8 sm:mb-11"
    >
      Ejecuta herramientas nativas en bucle, abre software, recuerda tus
      proyectos y reacciona emocionalmente en tiempo real mediante su avatar 3D
      interactivo. Conmutable al instante entre <strong
        class="text-white font-medium">Google Gemini Flash-Lite</strong
      > y <strong class="text-white font-medium">Modelos Locales</strong> sin censura
      ni pérdida de privacidad.
    </p>

    <!-- System Badges Feature -->
    <div
      class="hero-badges flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5 mb-8 sm:mb-11 text-xs font-mono"
    >
      <span
        class="hero-badge-item px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#0b132b] text-sky-300 border border-sky-800/60 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm"
      >
        🤖 Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite
      </span>
      <span
        class="hero-badge-item px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#1c0e35] text-purple-300 border border-purple-800/60 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm"
      >
        💻 Modo Local (Ollama / GGUF)
      </span>
      <span
        class="hero-badge-item px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#08221b] text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-800/60 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm"
      >
        🛡️ Auditoría Inmutable
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- CTAs (Generous spacing for download button) -->
    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-3"
    >
      <a
        class="hero-cta-btn w-full sm:w-auto px-10 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-ashly-cyan to-blue-600 hover:from-sky-300 hover:to-blue-500 text-slate-950 font-bold font-sora text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(23,184,254,0.45)] transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95"
        href="#descarga"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            d="M0 3.449L9.75 2.1v9.451H0m10.949-9.602L24 0v11.4H10.949M0 12.6h9.75v9.451L0 20.699M10.949 12.6H24V24l-13.051-1.802"
          ></path></svg
        >
        <span>Descargar Ashly para Windows</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="hero-subtext text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
      Versión 1.0.0 • 64-bit • Sin telemetría oculta
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
